Package: bloomr
Title: Interactive Hierarchical Geographic Bloom Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("George", "Arthur", , "prigasgenthian48@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1975-1459"))
Description: Embeds interactive geographic bloom maps in Shiny applications and
    HTML reports. Regions expand from their geographic origins while origin dots
    and dotted connector lines preserve the relationship to the parent geography.
    Includes prepared New Jersey and Texas boundaries with lazy local-area loading.
    The package ships a self-contained JavaScript visualization engine with
    light-first styling and supports selections, dragging, and reactive updates.
